-- Manual seed for Railway, mirroring prisma/seed.ts (generated from it with
-- pg_dump --data-only). Use when you can't run `npm run db:seed` against
-- Railway: deploy the app first (its pre-deploy step runs
-- `prisma migrate deploy`, which creates the "staffing" schema and tables),
-- then paste this into Railway → Postgres → Data → Query.
-- Only touches the "staffing" schema; the catalog app's tables in "public"
-- are left alone. Re-running it fails on duplicate ids — clear first with:
--   truncate staffing."Submission", staffing."Position", staffing."Engagement", staffing."User";

